# 6. Spaced Repetition Logic

For learning/revision, each topic creates future revision sessions.

Example:

```text
Day 0: Learn topic
Day 1: Revise
Day 3: Revise
Day 7: Revise
Day 14: Revise
Day 30: Final review
```

