# 11. Recommended Data Model

## `entries`

Stores the plan itself.

```json
{
  "plan_type": "learning",
  "start_date": "2026-06-10",
  "end_date": "2026-07-10",
  "frequency_per_week": 3,
  "revision_pattern": [1, 3, 7, 14, 30]
}
```

## `plan_sessions`

Stores actual scheduled/completed sessions.

```json
{
  "session_type": "revision",
  "topic": "EMA basics",
  "revision_number": 2,
  "confidence_before": "low",
  "confidence_after": "medium"
}
```

